      "message": "I\u0027m sorry, I was wrong.\n\nEarlier in oslo.db.options we used oslo.config `set_defaults` https://github.com/vikt0rs/oslo.db/blob/master/oslo/db/options.py#L140 method which has no cleanup mechanism https://github.com/openstack/oslo.config/blob/master/oslo/config/cfg.py#L558. A modern version of oslo.db uses `register_opts` method https://github.com/openstack/oslo.db/blob/master/oslo/db/options.py#L143 which has cleanup mechanism https://github.com/openstack/oslo.config/blob/master/oslo/config/cfg.py#L1729 https://github.com/openstack/oslo.config/blob/master/oslo/config/cfg.py#L1588.\n\nSo every execution all the options will be cleared. And we must set options at every fixture initialization, not just once.",
